sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: n/a<br>Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted
    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to reboot the Charging Station with status OnIdle

    CSMS->>CS: ResetRequest (type = OnIdle)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: ResetRequest<br>- type must be OnIdle<br>- evseId must be omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: ResetResponse (status = Scheduled)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = StopAuthorized, transactionInfo.chargingState = EVConnected, idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Ended, triggerReason = EVCommunicationLost, transactionInfo.chargingState = Idle, transactionInfo.stoppedReason = EVDisconnected)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest (reason = ScheduledReset)
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: BootNotificationResponse<br>- status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 9: The Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of all connectors
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available) / NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Available", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
    CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse / NotifyEventResponse (CSMS responds accordingly)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
